  "visual_review": "Inspected both complete native/control sheets and the close-up comparison. Native Hardened materials, tools and held armor highlights emit yellow light that disappears with zero emission alpha. Each worn armor piece glows independently and its pixel pattern remains distinguishable. The placed Hardened block is brighter than ordinary Glowstone and the alpha-zero control; its original simple yellow face and orange edge remain recognizable. All four dynamic-range assertions are linked to a matching authenticated companion-on profile."
